WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,616
Just take it away

2
00:00:01,616 --> 00:00:08,988
Is it really good? And what about Brother Liu and his share? They should have been divided equally by everyone.

3
00:00:08,988 --> 00:00:10,524
I want to stock up for myself

4
00:00:10,524 --> 00:00:12,367
You can find other supplies

5
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:14,210
Can't take advantage of them

6
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:15,328
so much meat

7
00:00:15,328 --> 00:00:17,285
It would be too eye-catching to exchange them all

8
00:00:17,285 --> 00:00:18,683
Easily robbed

9
00:00:18,683 --> 00:00:19,522
Exchange a small amount

10
00:00:19,522 --> 00:00:20,360
More peace of mind

11
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,479
Also more controllable

12
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:23,995
Besides, we ourselves are also short of meat

13
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:27,070
Liu Yang and Sister Wang mentioned it more than once

14
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:29,420
So she remembered it all?

15
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,216
Since we are traveling together

16
00:00:30,216 --> 00:00:32,007
Supplies on the road must be shared

17
00:00:32,007 --> 00:00:33,998
Put this meat in your space

18
00:00:33,998 --> 00:00:34,993
Also better to preserve

19
00:00:34,993 --> 00:00:36,386
When partners need it

20
00:00:36,386 --> 00:00:37,580
Will you refuse to give it?

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,404
Of course

22
00:00:38,404 --> 00:00:41,152
Sister Wang and her family took me out of City C

23
00:00:41,152 --> 00:00:42,525
Take care of me all the way

24
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:45,273
Fan Jiawen Yeli treats everyone's injuries

25
00:00:45,273 --> 00:00:47,196
Suzy has been dealing with it too

26
00:00:47,196 --> 00:00:47,745
It turns out

27
00:00:47,745 --> 00:00:49,943
He has long been regarded as one of his own

28
00:00:49,943 --> 00:00:51,042
your space

29
00:00:51,042 --> 00:00:53,240
Do all your teammates know?

30
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:56,590
Of course, they are all brothers who live and die together.
